---
import { localeFromPath, localizedPath } from "../i18n/config";
const locale = localeFromPath(Astro.url.pathname);
interface Props { compact?: boolean; }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class:list={{"tool-footer":compact}}>
  {compact && locale === "zh" ? <>
    <div class="tool-footer-intro"><strong>武夷山奶爸地图</strong><p>本人走过、拍过并整理的沿路地点。</p></div>
    <nav class="tool-footer-links" aria-label="奶爸地图快捷入口"><a href="/zh/explore-wuyishan">游客主题</a><a href="/zh/map#corridor">一号风景道</a><a href="/zh/why-wuyishan">了解武夷山</a></nav>
    <small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 武夷山奶爸</small>
  </> : compact ? <>
    <div class="tool-footer-intro"><strong>Local Dad Jeff · Wuyishan Map</strong><p>Places personally visited, photographed, and organized along the road.</p></div>
    <nav class="tool-footer-links" aria-label="Map links"><a href="/map">Map</a><a href="/why-wuyishan">Why Wuyishan</a><a href="/">Home</a></nav>
    <small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Local Dad Jeff</small>
  </> : locale === "zh" ? <>
    <div class="footer-intro"><p class="kicker">一个生活在武夷山的爸爸</p><h2>把自己认识的武夷山<br/><em>慢慢讲给你听。</em></h2><p>从山水、茶、森林和人文出发，也清楚标注仍在建设或暂不开放的地点。</p></div>
    <div class="footer-links"><div><p class="kicker">网站</p><a href={localizedPath("/why-wuyishan", locale)}>为什么是武夷山</a><a href={localizedPath("/explore-wuyishan", locale)}>探索武夷山</a><a href={localizedPath("/stories-of-wuyishan", locale)}>武夷山故事</a><a href={localizedPath("/map", locale)}>武夷山奶爸地图</a></div><div><p class="kicker">关于</p><a href={localizedPath("/about", locale)}>关于 Jeff</a><a href="/">English</a></div></div>
    <small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 武夷山奶爸 · 中国福建武夷山</small>
  </> : <>
    <div class="footer-intro"><p class="kicker">A personal guide to Wuyishan, China</p><h2>Notes from someone<br/><em>who lives here.</em></h2><p>Practical notes about the mountains, tea, family travel, and everyday life in my hometown.</p></div>
    <div class="footer-links"><div><p class="kicker">Website</p><a href={localizedPath("/why-wuyishan", locale)}>Why Wuyishan</a><a href={localizedPath("/explore-wuyishan", locale)}>Explore Wuyishan</a><a href={localizedPath("/map", locale)}>Wuyishan Map</a><a href={localizedPath("/stories-of-wuyishan", locale)}>Stories of Wuyishan</a></div><div><p class="kicker">More</p><a href={localizedPath("/wuyishan-guide", locale)}>Start Here</a><a href={localizedPath("/locations", locale)}>Locations</a><a href={localizedPath("/editorial-standards", locale)}>Editorial Standards</a></div></div>
    <small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Local Dad Jeff · Wuyishan, Fujian, China · Practical notes based on firsthand experience.</small>
  </>}
</footer>
